   <text>
      <body>
         <div xml:lang="en" type="translation">
            <ab>Heliodoros, writing, inquiring after his dear father and servant of God, Apa Abraham, the anchorite. Salutations in the Lord! Before everything I enquire after the your excellent Fatherhood with my whole heart and my whole soul. Truly, my dear Father, I cease not to think of you by day and by night since I went forth from you (and) went to Fau. And my father asked me about the health of your Fatherhood. Even as you look for us (?) so (?) we (?) look for (news of) your health . . . ";(Verso): "Give it to the holy father and X servant of God;                       Abraham. From                               Heliodoros."</ab>
         </div>
